{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"八年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"秋八月戊申，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"冬十月壬午，公子遂會晉趙盾，盟于衡雍。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"乙酉，公子遂會雒戎，盟于暴。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"公孫敖如京師，不至而復。丙戌，奔莒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"螽。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"宋人殺其大夫司馬。宋司城來奔。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"八年春，晉侯使解揚歸匡、戚之田于衛，且復致公壻池之封，自申至于虎牢之竟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"夏，秦人伐晉，取武城，以報令狐之役。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"秋，襄王崩。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"晉人以扈之盟來討。冬，襄仲會晉趙孟，盟于衡雍，報扈之盟也，遂會伊、雒之戎。書曰「公子遂」，珍之也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"穆伯如周弔喪，不至，以幣奔莒，從己氏焉。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"宋襄夫人，襄王之姊也，昭公不禮焉。夫人因戴氏之族，以殺襄公之孫孔叔、公孫鍾離及大司馬公子卬，皆昭公之黨也。司馬握節以死，故書以官。司城蕩意諸來奔，效節於府人而出。公以其官逆之，皆復之，亦書以官，皆貴之也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_104_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_104","textTraditional":"夷之蒐，晉侯將登箕鄭父、先都，而使士縠、梁益耳將中軍。先克曰：「狐、趙之勳，不可廢也。」從之。先克奪蒯得田于堇陰。故箕鄭父、先都、士縠、梁益耳、蒯得作亂。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}